    RowBox[{"Cos", "[", 
     RowBox[{"4", " ", "x"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"x", ",", "0", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID\
->"fcad922d-79ad-460b-9d86-e5e446bd169d"],

